        <briefdescription>
<para>Updates the FPS counter (should be called once per frame). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Updates the FPS counter and logs when interval elapses.</para>
<para>This method increments the frame count and, when the interval has elapsed, calculates and logs the average FPS.</para>
<para>This method should be called once per frame. It accumulates delta time and frame count, and when the interval is reached, it calculates the average FPS and logs it. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
