    <briefdescription>
<para>Utility class for measuring and logging frames per second. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class calculates the average FPS over a configurable interval, and logs it to the console. It also provides access to delta time and elapsed time values.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>FPS is calculated as frame count divided by elapsed time over the logging interval. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
